# Bot1 casts Delighted Halfling turn 1. On turn 5, once it has lost summoning sickness, Bot1 taps its second ability
# for black, restricted to legendary spells and uncounterable, and casts Cecil, Dark Knight with it. Bot2 taps two
# Islands for Counterspell, which resolves and does nothing: the mana that cast Cecil made it uncounterable.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Delighted Halfling
Cecil, Dark Knight
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Island
Counterspell
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Delighted Halfling.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Delighted Halfling.Activate(Color: Black; Ability: any color)
Bot1.Hand.Cecil, Dark Knight.Cast
? Stack = Cecil, Dark Knight
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Counterspell.Cast(Cecil, Dark Knight)
? Stack = Counterspell; Cecil, Dark Knight

